1
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:19,640
You're Su Muchen's sister?

2
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:22,280
Do you know why I asked you here?

3
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:27,000
I first met Zhou Jian

4
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,400
at a sword hall in France.

5
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:29,760
And this place

6
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:31,480
is a replica of

7
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:32,480
that sword hall.

8
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:35,440
You told Li Xiaorou

9
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:37,360
about Mumu?

10
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:38,880
How do you know?

11
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:41,120
My sister told me.

12
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:42,960
As for Li Xiaorou,

13
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:44,520
she knew from the beginning.

14
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,120
She even

15
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,560
told my sister about it.

16
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:48,760
Your hatred

17
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:51,120
is not just about Zhou Jian's betrayal.

18
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,640
What exactly is your purpose?

19
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:55,440
Lu Qianqian and Lu Xu are not siblings?

20
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:56,520
Yes.

21
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:58,000
After Mr. Lu passed away,

22
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,320
to get the 30% of the shares

23
00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:01,080
left by Grandpa Lu to Lu Qianqian,

24
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:02,760
Annie adopted her from the orphanage.

25
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:03,880
Then, with her own efforts,

26
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:05,240
she took over the entire Lu family's business

27
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:07,080
and took over the early Golden Silk Group.

28
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:08,800
Without Grandpa Lu

29
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:10,400
to stop her from exploiting raw material suppliers,

30
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:10,960
she

31
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:12,800
used a price war to gain a head start,

32
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,800
and grew into the current Golden Silk Group.

33
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:19,080
Low cost, high profit.

34
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,320
What's wrong, Muchen?

35
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:28,280
Xiaorou,

36
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,880
can you help me get the information

37
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:31,240
of the suppliers back then?

38
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:32,240
What are you going to do?

39
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:33,720
I think

40
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:34,920
there are some things

41
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,520
I need to look into more deeply.

42
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,240
Isn't what you've found enough?

43
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,040
Muchen,

44
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,400
stop here.

45
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,760
Annie is not someone you can mess with.

46
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:42,520
If you keep going like this,

47
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,640
you'll get stuck in the mud.

48
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:46,840
I'm already stuck in the mud.

49
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:48,320
Help me.

50
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:49,840
I'm sorry.

51
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,080
I can't help you anymore.

52
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,560
You have to learn to face reality.

53
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,240
What else did Su Muchen find out?

54
00:03:09,320 --> 00:03:10,760
You don't need to worry about it.

55
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,120
But you came to me today,

56
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:15,120
which means you're ready to break away from the Lu family.

57
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:16,240
Isn't that right?

58
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:19,360
You're very smart.

59
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:20,800
Soon,

60
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:22,480
the Lu family and I

61
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:24,280
will have no connection at all.

62
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:26,320
You're in such a hurry to see me.

63
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:28,760
Are you trying to confirm if I'm your target?

64
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:32,240
Now I know the answer.

65
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:35,560
I can transfer the 10% of shares to you.

66
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:37,240
But you must ensure

67
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,880
that Annie has no chance

68
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,320
to take Mumu from me.

69
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,560
You believe I can win?

70
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,160
At least now,

71
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:46,040
only you dare to compete with her.

72
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,680
I just want Mumu.

73
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,520
That's enough.

74
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:53,280
Okay.

75
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,680
I promise you.

76
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:18,360
Qianqian went to Singapore to find Dean Li.

77
00:04:18,960 --> 00:04:19,680
She might

78
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:21,960
have known that you're not her biological mother.

79
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:22,880
And,

80
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:25,080
she has given away her shares.

81
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:26,920
4% of them

82
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:27,880
were bought by Zhuang Wan.

83
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:30,080
The remaining 11%

84
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:31,560
were transferred to Jiang Li

85
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,600
through a third party.

86
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:34,520
Mumu is not Zhou Jian's child,

87
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:35,760
but Lu Xu's.

88
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:37,440
She might know it.

89
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,840
What about Jiang Li?

90
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:40,960
Her name is Su Muli.

91
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:43,120
She is the sister of Su Muchen, Zhou Jian's ex-wife.

92
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:44,760
Su Muli.

93
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:48,960
The elder sister died in the fire.

94
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,560
The younger sister came to avenge her.

95
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:53,560
I thought she was just a scavenging dog.

96
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:55,000
I didn't expect

97
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,440
it was a demon.

98
00:04:58,960 --> 00:05:00,880
How much does Jiang Li know

99
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:02,320
about what Su Muchen found out back then?

100
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,920
I'm not sure about that.

101
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:08,320
Better be safe than sorry.

102
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:11,840
If Jiang Li knows something she shouldn't,

103
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:14,640
Wu,

104
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:18,320
you know what to do.

105
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,120
Jenny, I know you're home.

106
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:57,680
I'd like to talk to you.

107
00:06:08,520 --> 00:06:09,520
What do you want?

108
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:11,840
Just say it here.

109
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:14,360
Discuss my attempted murder at the door?

110
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:15,360
Are you sure?

111
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:45,080
Don't be so nervous.

112
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,280
I didn't call the police.

113
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:50,120
Are you that kind?

114
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:51,120
Of course not.

115
00:06:51,320 --> 00:06:52,520
I have a condition.

116
00:06:53,280 --> 00:06:54,480
What condition?

117
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:57,640
Are you just going to stand there and talk to me?

118
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:11,080
I can pretend nothing happened,

119
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:13,160
and you can keep being a fashion designer.

120
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:16,720
But I want the raw material test report

121
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:19,040
of the golden thread clothes your father hid.

122
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,200
I don't know anything.

123
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:23,800
All he left me after he died

124
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:26,520
was debt and a bottle of antidepressants.

125
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:29,920
What are you doing?

126
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:31,240
Don't come over.

127
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:32,320
Don't come over.

128
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:34,080
[Parents working away from home.]

129
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:35,880
[Lived with grandmother since childhood.]

130
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:38,240
[Dreamed of becoming a fashion designer.]

131
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:40,360
[But was mocked and isolated by classmates.]

132
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:41,960
[Self-taught in fashion design.]

133
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:45,160
[Failed three art exams due to excessive nervousness.]

134
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:48,200
[Kneeled before design institutes seeking mentorship but was rejected.]

135
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:50,280
[Got into Golden Thread because her father]

136
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:52,440
[was an original employee.]

137
00:07:59,440 --> 00:08:01,640
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

138
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:02,720
I'm sorry.

139
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:05,000
I regretted

140
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,240
pushing you into the river.

141
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:09,240
I just want to design clothes

142
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:11,840
that make all girls look like fairy princesses.

143
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:15,080
I really want to design Dark Fairy Tale.

144
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,800
Jenny, do you know where the report is?

145
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,840
You know everything that happened back then, don't you?

146
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:20,640
I don't know.

147
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:22,040
You didn't go to Annie

148
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,880
but went to Lu Xu for cooperation after getting my materials.

149
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:24,880
because you were afraid of her,

150
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:25,720
weren't you?

151
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,120
Right?

152
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:26,640
I don't know.

153
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:27,440
I don't know.

154
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,880
Don't push me anymore.

155
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:30,400
I don't know anything.

156
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,040
Who are you?

157
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,800
What do you want these files for?

158
00:08:34,160 --> 00:08:35,880
Some secrets shouldn't be hidden.

159
00:08:35,920 --> 00:08:38,120
The victims deserve justice.

160
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:40,320
Your parents gave you a chance with their lives,

161
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:42,840
not to associate with the devil.

162
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:50,720
A designer's hands should hold brushes and needles,

163
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,240
not weapons.

164
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:55,080
I'll give you time to think it over.

165
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:20,360
Jiang Li, are you crazy?

166
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:22,240
Why did you go to Jenny alone?

167
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:24,000
He almost killed you.

168
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:26,200
I'm not dead, am I?

169
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:28,760
Since you accepted my help,

170
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,960
you shouldn't hide anything from me.

171
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:32,280
I just want to avenge my sister.

172
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:33,640
You know that.

173
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,000
Jiang Li.

174
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:41,520
The fire in the chemical fiber factory 20 years ago

175
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:42,400
was not an accident.

176
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,280
You didn't tell me anything.

177
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,120
Shen Jingmo.

178
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:48,080
Before we met at the convenience store,

179
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:50,560
I don't remember when and where I met you.

180
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:52,880
Why are you always following me like a shadow?

181
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:57,800
Because you once warmed countless people like the sun.

182
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:00,440
[I was one of them.]

183
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:03,480
[I know there are many people like me in the world.]

184
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:05,600
[But I think]

185
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:08,080
[I'm the luckiest one.]

186
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:09,600
[Because I]

187
00:10:10,160 --> 00:10:11,920
[can meet you again.]

188
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:19,040
This is my sister's diary.

189
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:40,200
She wanted to prove the child wasn't Zhou Jian's through genetic testing,

190
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:42,920
but she accidentally discovered the truth about my parents' death.

191
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:46,480
The predecessor of Golden Thread, Xingyue Group,

192
00:10:46,760 --> 00:10:48,520
rotten meat under the bright appearance.

193
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:52,040
[They used synthetic fibers to pass off as silk.]

194
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:52,840
Su Mingyuan,

195
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:53,840
are you out of your mind?

196
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:56,200
This could land you in prison!

197
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,360
Keep your voice down!

198
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:00,600
After Mr. Lu's death,

199
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:02,320
President An took over Xingyue.

200
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:05,000
She gave us two options:

201
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:07,440
either get out of Xingyue's supply chain,

202
00:11:08,040 --> 00:11:10,160
or accept their low prices.

203
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:12,880
It's hard to find a client

204
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:15,160
with such a large demand as Xingyue Group.

205
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:17,520
If we're kicked out of their supply chain,

206
00:11:17,640 --> 00:11:19,880
we'll have to lay off half of our staff.

207
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:22,680
These are employees who have been with me for over a decade.

208
00:11:23,040 --> 00:11:24,000
They have families to support,

209
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:25,000
with elders to care for

210
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,560
and children to raise.

211
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:28,240
I can't bear to lay off anyone.

212
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:30,600
But now we're getting customer complaints

213
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:31,880
of allergic reactions and skin ulcers.

214
00:11:32,160 --> 00:11:34,000
We're risking people's health

215
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,440
to earn a living for our factory.

216
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,160
How could you come up

217
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:38,920
with such a conscienceless solution?

218
00:11:39,160 --> 00:11:40,520
It's all Assistant Wu's fault.

219
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:43,280
He told me to do it.

220
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:48,080
He said as long as we help Xingyue win this price war,

221
00:11:48,280 --> 00:11:50,240
the acquisition price will return to what it was before.

222
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:51,560
He also said

223
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:53,320
that Xingyue would take responsibility for any issues.

224
00:11:54,040 --> 00:11:55,120
I heard

225
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:57,760
[reporters are already investigating this.]

226
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,000
If it's exposed,

227
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:00,360
the factory will be done for.

228
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:04,520
Mingyuan,

229
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:05,840
where are you going so late?

230
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:06,720
I have something to do.

231
00:12:06,760 --> 00:12:07,680
I'll be back soon.

232
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:11,520
[Later, I found out that night,]

233
00:12:11,880 --> 00:12:13,760
[Dad went out to meet Assistant Wu.]

234
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:18,440
What do you mean by this?

235
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:21,360
The money in here

236
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:23,800
for rebuilding the new factory.

237
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:26,520
Destroy all the synthetic materials

238
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:28,840
before it's exposed.

239
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:30,080
Destroy?

240
00:12:31,880 --> 00:12:33,160
How do I destroy them?

241
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:35,920
Water?

242
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:36,880
Fire?

243
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:38,280
Whatever.

244
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:43,280
Just make sure they're destroyed thoroughly.

245
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:58,240
So your father caused a short circuit

246
00:12:58,240 --> 00:12:59,360
to create an accident on purpose.

247
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:00,640
But your mother didn't know that,

248
00:13:00,640 --> 00:13:02,040
so she went in to put out the fire.

249
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:05,400
As a result, your father saved your mother.

250
00:13:05,760 --> 00:13:06,840
Cause and effect.

251
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:10,040
My father's price for dealing with the devil.

252
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:12,720
But the real culprit

253
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:17,280
is those who manipulate the lives of others behind the scenes.

254
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:18,480
So,

255
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:27,200
what are you going to do next?

256
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:30,680
Jenny is unwilling to show the clothing test report from that year

257
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:32,040
because she is afraid of Annie.

258
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:34,560
to pry off the diamonds under Annie's crown

259
00:13:34,640 --> 00:13:36,880
at the next shareholders' meeting.

260
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:39,200
Zhuang Wan's shares are crucial.

261
00:13:41,520 --> 00:13:42,640
Okay.

262
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:52,880
There are so many women in the world,

263
00:13:53,680 --> 00:13:57,080
but you fell in love with the one you shouldn't.

264
00:13:59,400 --> 00:14:02,760
You made Lu Qianqian pregnant.

265
00:14:02,960 --> 00:14:06,160
I concealed everything for your own good.

266
00:14:06,400 --> 00:14:08,680
Why don't you listen to me?

267
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,760
Why did you open that Pandora's box?

268
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:16,520
At this time,

269
00:14:16,640 --> 00:14:20,040
shouldn't you be taking Mumu to school?

270
00:14:20,400 --> 00:14:22,840
This morning, the Madam took the Young Master to the airport.

271
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:25,320
She said she was going to Switzerland to see the snow.

272
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:26,720
Switzerland?

273
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:28,040
Where's Zhou Jian?

274
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:29,520
Isn't he with them?

275
00:14:29,640 --> 00:14:31,840
The Master went to Milan for procurement a few days ago.

276
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:33,400
He won't be back until next week.

277
00:14:36,760 --> 00:14:37,720
Got it.

278
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:39,320
You can go.

279
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:40,200
OK.

280
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:48,360
Wu,

281
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:51,120
freeze Lu Qianqian's card.

282
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:54,000
Find out where she took Mumu as soon as possible.

283
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:15,360
Why are you crying?

284
00:15:15,360 --> 00:15:17,040
Is it because I'm not good?

285
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:22,720
You are the best baby in the world.

286
00:15:23,680 --> 00:15:27,320
I'll take you to the Alps for snow.

287
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:29,240
and to Nara to feed the deer.

288
00:15:30,160 --> 00:15:31,400
From now on,

289
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:33,760
no old house,

290
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:36,040
no etiquette class,

291
00:15:37,160 --> 00:15:40,360
only Mumu and Mom's adventure.

292
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:41,840
What about Dad?

293
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:44,640
Grandma said she would take me on a big cruise at Christmas.

294
00:15:48,680 --> 00:15:50,120
They are all too busy

295
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:52,880
to spend time with Mumu.

296
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:56,040
So from now on,

297
00:15:58,200 --> 00:16:04,320
Mom is the only family Mumu has in the world.
